# CONTACT-SHADOWS: FIELD_Barn with the PostProcess Contact Shadows (UE ContactShadowLength march, Common/ContactShadow.glslh)
# off and on; the sun from the side so the grass bases, the barn's steps and stones and the bark carry thin contacts.
Дано run Scene "Open Scene FIELD_Barn.desce"
Дано run View "View mode: Lit"
Дано run Entity "Sun"
Дано --subject selection set SunElevation 25
Дано --subject selection set SunAzimuth 110
Дано --subject viewport set Camera.Position 0,900,2500
Дано --subject viewport set Camera.Direction 0.15,-0.15,-1
Когда set 8180000000000003 PostProcessVolumeData.Settings.ContactShadows false
Тогда-вид 1_off contact shadows off: grass bases, stones and the barn's steps lit to the ground
Когда set 8180000000000003 PostProcessVolumeData.Settings.ContactShadows true
Тогда-вид 2_on thin dark contacts at the grass bases, under the barn's stones/steps and in the bark folds; beyond 50 m as 1_off; no bands or stairs
Когда --subject viewport set Camera.Position 300,250,900
Когда --subject viewport set Camera.Direction 0.2,-0.35,-1
Когда set 8180000000000003 PostProcessVolumeData.Settings.ContactShadows false
Тогда-вид 3_close_off close to the grass, contacts off
Когда set 8180000000000003 PostProcessVolumeData.Settings.ContactShadows true
Тогда-вид 4_close_on close to the grass, contacts on: each blade's base darkened, no grain
